{"created": "2023-08-09T19:02:49.087730+00:00", "modified": "2024-07-11T13:34:41.477146+00:00", "id": 8230330, "conceptrecid": "8229045", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.8229045", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "metadata": {"title": "Bj\u00f6rk\u00f6 Wind Turbine Version 1 (45kW) high frequency Structural Health Monitoring (SHM) data", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "publication_date": "2023-08-09", "description": "<p>The Chalmers wind turbine has variable speed operation with a direct driven generator and a frequency converter, it also has a digital control system developed by Chalmers. The wind turbine has a rated power of 45 kW and rated speed of 75 rpm. The wooden tower is 30 m high, the blades of carbon fibres are 7.5 m long, and the turbine diameter is 15.9 m. The individually blade pitch system is electrical. The turbine is situated on the island Bj&ouml;rk&ouml; at Skarviksv&auml;gen, 20 km west of G&ouml;teborg city. The coordinates are: 57.71818820625921, 11.683382148764485.</p>\n\n<p><br>\n69 SCADA and structural vibration and loads Channels timeseries&nbsp;(sampled at 20 and 100 Hz) such as nacelle accelerations, tower and blades bending moments are included.</p>\n\n<p><br>\nStructured metadata about wind turbine characteristics,&nbsp;SCADA, vibration and loads channels are included as JSON files and CSV.</p>\n\n<p>This particular dataset consisting of high frequency sampled data, is intended for condition and structural health analysis.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The data covers:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>the measurements sampled at 100 Hz correspond to the period from 05 July 2022 to 9 June 2023</li>\n\t<li>the measurements sampled at 20 Hz correspond to the period from 05 July 2022 to 2 August 2023</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>This repository includes:</strong></p>\n\n<p><strong>Time-series data in csv format:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>B1_CL4_20.csv (this is the data sampled at 20 Hz)</li>\n\t<li>B1_CL4_100.csv (this is the data sampled at 100 Hz)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Metadata:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Bjorko_Sensors_Specs_Metadata.csv (Sensors signals specification in csv format)</li>\n\t<li>Bjorko_modes_mapping.csv (numerical integer value representing the wind turbine controller system mode in csv format)</li>\n\t<li>Bjorko_modes_mapping.json (numerical integer value representing the wind turbine controller system mode in csv JSON format)</li>\n\t<li>Bjorko_digital_io_states_mappings.csv (Description of digital input and output states in the wind turbine controller system in csv format)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Media:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Chalmers-Wind turbine.pdf (description of the wind turbine including pictures)</li>\n\t<li>Chalmers wind turbine description 220121-short.pdf (description of the wind turbine including pictures)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Semantic artifacts:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>N/A</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>Other:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>N/A</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Additional information is available upon request.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Sara Fogelstr\u00f6m", "affiliation": "Chalmers University of Technology"}, {"name": "H\u00e5kan Johansson", "affiliation": "Chalmers University of Technology"}, {"name": "Ola Carlson", "affiliation": "Chalmers University of Technology"}, {"name": "Martin Hofs\u00e4\u00df", "affiliation": "enviConnect"}, {"name": "Oliver Bischoff", "affiliation": "enviConnect"}, {"name": "Yuriy Marykovskiy", "affiliation": "OST"}, {"name": "Imad Abdallah", "affiliation": "ETH Zurich"}], "keywords": ["wind energy", "wind turbines", "condition monitoring", "structural health monitoring", "accelerations", "strain", "loads", "SCADA", "open access", "Chalmers University of Technology", "Bj\u00f6rk\u00f6 Wind Turbine"], "subjects": [{"term": "condition monitoring", "identifier": "http://purl.org/weave/ConditionMonitoring", "scheme": "purl"}, {"term": "wind turbine", "identifier": "http://purl.org/neat/WindTurbine", "scheme": "purl"}], "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "grants": [{"code": "101017536", "internal_id": "10.13039/501100000780::101017536", "funder": {"name": "European Commission", "doi": "10.13039/501100000780", "acronym": "EC"}, "title": "EOSC Future", "acronym": "EOSC Future", "program": "H2020-EU.1.4.", "url": "https://cordis.europa.eu/projects/101017536"}], "communities": [{"id": "eu"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "8229045"}}]}}, "title": "Bj\u00f6rk\u00f6 Wind Turbine Version 1 (45kW) high frequency Structural Health Monitoring (SHM) data", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8230330", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8230330", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8230330?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8230330", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8230330/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8229045", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8229045", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8229045", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8229045", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8230330/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8230330/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8230330/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8230330/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8230330:_Chalmers%20wind%20turbine%20description%20220121-short.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8230330:_Chalmers%20wind%20turbine%20description%20220121-short.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:8